			"notes": "## Region grid renderer patch:\n\n### Added\n\n- Added animation of textures for highlighting region conflict zones\n\n- Automatically switches rendering mode when enabling/disabling iris shaders\n\n### Changed\n\n- Improved visibility of grid edges and faces using shaders (not supported by all shaders)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Completely reworked rendering code\n\n- Improved optimization\n\n- Fixed a bug that caused grid colors to display incorrectly when using shaders"
		},
